{"id":"n77101-2-11","stage":4,"title":"주체 · 主体","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77101-2-11-1","ko":"네가 주체가 돼서 이 모임을 이끌어 보렴.","zh":"你试着主动带带这次聚会吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"주체가","meaning":"主体","explanation":"주체：主体；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"주체","audio":"/audio/34fe964f1d9eefa69fa1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77101","senseId":"2","lemma":"주체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주체가","audio":"/audio/9c4952bf10b383ab155e.mp3"}},{"text":"돼서","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼서","audio":"/audio/c6c8c7de6c212f9fe8d1.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"모임을","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모임을","audio":"/audio/29819118e1c83ef41fa9.mp3"}},{"text":"이끌어","meaning":"引导","explanation":"이끌다：引导；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"이끌다","audio":"/audio/90029ec3072fe5ec2979.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17971","senseId":"3","lemma":"이끌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이끌어","audio":"/audio/75a568ca965c9599cfbd.mp3"}},{"text":"보렴.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보렴","audio":"/audio/65472a08976eb419cdec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"34fe964f1d9eefa6","term":"주체","zh":"主体","audio":"/audio/34fe964f1d9eefa69fa1.mp3","entryId":"77101","definition":"事物的运动或某种行为的中心。","pronunciation":["주체"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"2485fc53da01e9d6","term":"모임","zh":"聚会","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3","entryId":"61519","definition":"多人为做某事而聚在一起的行为。","pronunciation":["모임"]},{"id":"90029ec3072fe5ec","term":"이끌다","zh":"引导","audio":"/audio/90029ec3072fe5ec2979.mp3","entryId":"17971","definition":"引领人或团体并主导下去。","pronunciation":["이끌다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b190fed4ed47099a297.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77101-2-11-2","ko":"네, 앞으로 잘해 볼게요.","zh":"好的，我以后会努力做好它的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term"